<h2>Exploring materials at model scale</h2>
<p>A material that works in a full-size building does not necessarily produce the same visual effect in a scale model. Transparency, texture and thickness all influence how a miniature façade is perceived.</p>
<p>We tested options for representing the windows, glazing and mesh with the design team. Physical samples provided a shared reference for reviewing these elements and discussing their suitability for the competition model.</p>
