<h2>Connecting design and fabrication</h2>
<p>Material testing creates an opportunity to resolve model-making details collaboratively. Designers can review physical representations of their ideas, while fabricators assess how to construct and integrate the selected elements.</p>
<p>This project demonstrates how architectural model making can support the development of a competition presentation, from the overall building form to the materials used to express its details.</p>
